      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Writing good STATA code was important for my academic career. It looks like that skill is largely becoming obsolete post Sonnet 4.6. (Also take this is as a notice to academics who still think of AI in terms of chatbots, not agents, that a lot has changed in a year) \n\nPaper: cepr.org/voxeu/column...",
